every year on that day

813
01:12:10.159 --> 01:12:12.571
and replace her three
slaughtered children

814
01:12:12.662 --> 01:12:14.039
with those from the living.

815
01:12:15.731 --> 01:12:17.836
That's all the
information I have, Mike.

816
01:12:17.900 --> 01:12:20.141
Thank you.

817
01:12:28.477 --> 01:12:29.512
Watch out!

818
01:13:52.662 --> 01:13:53.834
It's 10:15.

819
01:13:53.996 --> 01:13:55.100
You need you to go find Charlie.

820
01:13:55.164 --> 01:13:56.609
He needs you, I'm fine.

821
01:13:56.666 --> 01:13:58.270
Stay here, buddy,
we're gonna get you fixed up.

822
01:13:58.334 --> 01:13:59.904
Only when I know
you're all right.

823
01:14:01.170 --> 01:14:02.513
She going to be okay'?

824
01:14:02.972 --> 01:14:04.178
She'll be fine, sir.

825
01:14:04.674 --> 01:14:06.354
We're gonna need to do
some X-rays, though.

826
01:14:07.810 --> 01:14:09.016
Let me clean that up for you.

827
01:14:09.512 --> 01:14:10.650
Police are on their way.

828
01:14:11.981 --> 01:14:13.016
Go.

829
01:14:15.184 --> 01:14:16.356
Hey!

830
01:15:16.846 --> 01:15:17.847
Hello?

831
01:15:19.315 --> 01:15:20.419
Anybody here?

832
01:15:21.484 --> 01:15:22.554
Hello?

833
01:15:23.486 --> 01:15:27.901
Anybody?

834
01:15:33.763 --> 01:15:34.867
Somebody there?

835
01:15:51.113 --> 01:15:52.615
Can somebody help me?

836
01:15:58.187 --> 01:15:59.427
Why is everybody gone?

837
01:15:59.922 --> 01:16:00.923
It's Halloween.

838
01:16:01.257 --> 01:16:02.702
Ghosts are all out.

839
01:16:03.926 --> 01:16:05.269
Why'd you come back'?

840
01:16:05.694 --> 01:16:06.729
I need your help.

841
01:16:07.129 --> 01:16:09.735
How do I find the crying woman?

842
01:16:10.533 --> 01:16:12.035
What do you want from her'?

843
01:16:12.802 --> 01:16:13.872
My child back.

844
01:16:17.073 --> 01:16:18.313
Give me your watch.

845
01:16:22.044 --> 01:16:24.547
You wanna cross over to
the other side or not?

846
01:16:31.821 --> 01:16:32.822
You can see?

847
01:16:33.656 --> 01:16:35.329
I'm blind as a bat.

848
01:16:36.759 --> 01:16:37.794
Not deaf.

849
01:16:40.096 --> 01:16:41.131
Take me to her.

850
01:16:50.239 --> 01:16:51.650
The portal is open.

851
01:16:52.174 --> 01:16:54.677
What you're looking for
is on the other side.

852
01:16:55.845 --> 01:16:58.018
You better be back
before midnight.

853
01:16:58.481 --> 01:16:59.516
What happens then?

854
01:16:59.849 --> 01:17:01.021
Halloween's over.

855
01:17:01.350 --> 01:17:05.264
You're not back,
you'll be trapped in there.

856
01:17:08.190 --> 01:17:09.294
Oh, wait.

857
01:17:10.292 --> 01:17:11.771
Might need this.

858
01:17:12.828 --> 01:17:14.171
A lot more than I do.

859
01:19:02.304 --> 01:19:03.806
You will pay!

860
01:19:11.146 --> 01:19:12.921
Annie Sawquin.

861
01:21:34.256 --> 01:21:35.257
Charlie?

862
01:22:19.668 --> 01:22:20.738
Charlie,

863
01:22:22.104 --> 01:22:23.174
I'm here, son.

864
01:22:23.772 --> 01:22:24.773
I'm here.

865
01:22:29.745 --> 01:22:30.849
Where are you, Charlie?

866
01:22:45.027 --> 01:22:46.097
My son.

867
01:22:47.696 --> 01:22:48.674
My boy.

868
01:22:48.764 --> 01:22:50.004
Is it really you, Dad?

869
01:22:50.833 --> 01:22:52.471
I missed you so much.

870
01:22:54.703 --> 01:22:56.148
I'll take you home now.

871
01:23:01.543 --> 01:23:02.954
Can we come, too?

872
01:23:05.447 --> 01:23:07.324
This is Mia and Pablo, Dad.

873
01:23:07.649 --> 01:23:09.060
We were brought here together.

874
01:23:12.387 --> 01:23:13.457
There's no time.

875
01:23:14.022 --> 01:23:15.194
We have to stay together.

876
01:23:40.549 --> 01:23:41.721
Come on, keep moving.

877
01:23:42.251 --> 01:23:43.389
We're almost there.

878
01:24:13.348 --> 01:24:14.383
Get behind me.

879
01:24:20.455 --> 01:24:21.729
Dad!

880
01:24:40.809 --> 01:24:41.810
Dad!

881
01:24:48.550 --> 01:24:49.551
No!

882
01:25:01.830 --> 01:25:03.104
Help him!

883
01:25:41.937 --> 01:25:43.211
Dad, the bridge!

884
01:25:44.272 --> 01:25:45.216
Come on!

885
01:25:53.448 --> 01:25:54.518
Let's go!

886
01:26:19.174 --> 01:26:20.209
I got you.

887
01:26:29.985 --> 01:26:31.362
Put your arm around my neck.

888
01:26:45.767 --> 01:26:47.371
I got you, Dad.

889
01:26:56.778 --> 01:26:57.916
Let's go home.

890
01:27:14.763 --> 01:27:15.764
Charlie?

891
01:27:17.099 --> 01:27:18.134
Mom.

892
01:27:31.613 --> 01:27:32.819
Come here.

893
01:27:33.281 --> 01:27:34.624
Oh, my goodness.

894
01:27:42.591 --> 01:27:43.592
Where were you?

895
01:27:43.992 --> 01:27:45.096
Where were you?

896
01:27:45.460 --> 01:27:46.666
At the Halloween Fair.

897
01:27:47.329 --> 01:27:49.104
Dad and I had so much fun.

898
01:27:49.431 --> 01:27:50.501
There it is.

899
01:27:51.900 --> 01:27:53.106
I thought I lost it.

900
01:27:55.837 --> 01:27:57.316
He doesn't remember anything'?

901
01:28:00.976 --> 01:28:03.786
Dad promised me next year
I can be a superhero.

902
01:28:03.845 --> 01:28:05.188
You'll be a superhero.

903
01:28:05.747 --> 01:28:07.351
You're gonna be a
great superhero.

904
01:28:08.517 --> 01:28:09.928
Why are you crying?

905
01:28:12.687 --> 01:28:14.030
I'm really happy to see you.

906
01:28:14.589 --> 01:28:15.590
That's all, that's all.

907
01:28:16.024 --> 01:28:17.526
I'm just happy to see you.

908
01:28:20.128 --> 01:28:21.198
Thank you.
